    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ProjectClose (Darwin tool)\n\nThin, fast tool: resolve project (id or name, ilike), refuse ambiguous/empty/running cases, insert a project_analysis_run row (the partial unique index enforces one running run per project — on conflict do nothing catches races), fire ProjectAnalysisOrchestrator async, return at once.\n\nThe heavy lifting (L0-L3, notifications) happens in the orchestrator. See darwin/plans/close-project.md.",
        "color": 5
      },
